# A small modular-kit demo room, authored on the modular tileset (10) so the
# polygon renderer clads its floor, ceiling and walls from the mossy dungeon
# kit through the normal map-load path. The open area spans cells 4..11,
# aligned to the kit's 4-unit grid, and the default sector is three units tall
# to match the kit's native wall height. This is the first authored map that
# wears a modular kit; the zones migrate later.
map KITROOM
size 16 16
tileset 10
sector 0 0 48
walls
1111111111111111
1111111111111111
1111111111111111
1111111111111111
1111000000001111
1111000000001111
1111000000001111
1111000000001111
1111000000001111
1111000000001111
1111000000001111
1111000000001111
1111111111111111
1111111111111111
1111111111111111
1111111111111111
end
marker START 7 7 N
